  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "设向量 $a_1=(1,2,0,1)^T,\\ a_2=(0,1,1,-1)^T,\\ a_3=(1,1,1,0)^T$ 张成 $\\mathbb{R}^4$ 的子空间 $V$，求 $V$ 关于标准内积的一组正规正交基。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "Gram-Schmidt正交化",
    "内积空间",
    "正规正交基"
  ],
  "question_type": "正交化问题",
  "method": [
    "Gram-Schmidt正交化过程"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "取 $u_1=a_1$",
    "计算 $u_2=a_2-\\text{proj}_{u_1}a_2$",
    "计算 $u_3=a_3-\\text{proj}_{u_1}a_3-\\text{proj}_{u_2}a_3$",
    "归一化得到 $e_1,e_2,e_3$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "gram_schmidt_orthonormalization",
    "template": "\\text{正交化 } a_1,a_2,a_3\\in\\mathbb{R}^4",
    "variable_count": 12
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "正规正交基",
      "steps": [
        "$u_1=a_1=(1,2,0,1)$，$\\|u_1\\|^2=1+4+0+1=6$",
        "$a_2\\cdot u_1=0+2+0-1=1$，$u_2=a_2-\\dfrac16 u_1=(-1/6,2/3,1,-7/6)$，用比例向量 $v_2=(-1,4,6,-7)$（即 $6u_2$），$\\|v_2\\|^2=1+16+36+49=102$",
        "$a_3\\cdot u_1=1+2+0+0=3$，投影系数 $=3/6=1/2$；$a_3\\cdot u_2=3/2$，$u_2\\cdot u_2=17/6$，投影系数 $=\\dfrac{3/2}{17/6}=9/17$",
        "$u_3=a_3-\\dfrac12 u_1-\\dfrac{9}{17}u_2$，计算得 $u_3\\propto(5,-3,4,1)$，$\\|(5,-3,4,1)\\|^2=25+9+16+1=51$",
        "验证正交性：$(1,2,0,1)\\cdot(5,-3,4,1)=5-6+0+1=0$；$(-1,4,6,-7)\\cdot(5,-3,4,1)=-5-12+24-7=0$，验证成立",
        "结论：正规正交基为 $e_1=\\dfrac{(1,2,0,1)}{\\sqrt6},\\ e_2=\\dfrac{(-1,4,6,-7)}{\\sqrt{102}},\\ e_3=\\dfrac{(5,-3,4,1)}{\\sqrt{51}}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
